# Fetch the latest virtio-win ISO nightly. Install to /etc/cron.d/download-virtio-win.
#
# /etc/cron.d entries take a user field between the schedule and the command,
# which the previous version omitted, so cron parsed the script path as the
# username. Its day-of-month field was also 0, which is out of range (1-31).
# Between them the job never ran.
#
# --cron suppresses the progress bar so a no-op run produces no cron mail.

0 0 * * * root /opt/ergosteur/download-virtio-win-progress.py --cron --dir /var/lib/vz/template/iso/
